Casterwill's younger son fought alongside hisfamily in the great war against the [[Nullifiers]]. {{source|Knight of the Willblade}}

He and his siblings were teleported by [[Umbra]] to the [[Spiral Mark]], where he watched Lord Casterwill seal the Mark using the [[Willblade]]. {{source|The Spiral Mark}}

Some time after the death of Lord Casterwill, on the longest night of the year, he and his siblings fought [[the Betrayer]] at the [[Spiral Mark]], stopping him from using [[Void]] to call back the Nullifiers. {{source|Chasing Void}}

He eventually laid the [[Ring]] of [[Mythras]] to rest in the [[Fortress of Iron Will]] where the [[Rue Guardian]]s created the Trial of Courage as means of gaining leadership of the family. The ring was eventually recovered by [[Sophie Casterwill]] who gave it to [[Vivian Casterwill]]. {{source|Sophie on Trial}} {{Source|The Spiral War}}
